    "detailed_description": "<h1>Bird Coloring</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/af511f8db4146ed7add9ce6c42cbdd1b.avif?t=1754314639\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Coloring invites you into a peaceful world where creativity flows and stress fades away. Relax as you bring beautiful birds to life with your own unique touch, letting colors blend and imagination soar. It's your moment of calm in a busy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.poster.avif?t=1754314639\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.webm?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.mp4?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Bird Coloring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Coloring is your escape into a world of creativity and relaxation. As you bring each bird to life with your own colors, the stress of the day melts away. Every stroke feels satisfying, every choice is yours, and there\u2019s no wrong way to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.poster.avif?t=1754314639\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.webm?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.mp4?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re adding vibrant splashes or gentle shades, the experience is calming and rewarding. Let your imagination take flight as you fill each bird with personality and charm. Sit back, unwind, and enjoy the simple joy of coloring!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Coloring invites you into a peaceful world where creativity flows and stress fades away. Relax as you bring beautiful birds to life with your own unique touch, letting colors blend and imagination soar. It's your moment of calm in a busy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.poster.avif?t=1754314639\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.webm?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/854c40cad3772d9e6c0093875500fd5d.mp4?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Bird Coloring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Coloring is your escape into a world of creativity and relaxation. As you bring each bird to life with your own colors, the stress of the day melts away. Every stroke feels satisfying, every choice is yours, and there\u2019s no wrong way to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.poster.avif?t=1754314639\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.webm?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/f4ac2b3aec3535571ce507edf6160acc.mp4?t=1754314639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re adding vibrant splashes or gentle shades, the experience is calming and rewarding. Let your imagination take flight as you fill each bird with personality and charm. Sit back, unwind, and enjoy the simple joy of coloring!</p>",
